      "attrs": {
        "title": "Ticket lifecycle"
      },
      "body": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "text": "A ticket is `open`, then `triaged`, then `resolved` or `escalated`.\nOnly a human moves a ticket to `resolved`."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "example",
